window.__T__=[{"i":10040,"text":"Use my uploaded photo as the exact facial reference, preserving my real face, skin tone, and features with high accuracy. Create a photorealistic low-angle street-style portrait during {argument name=\"time of day\" default=\"golden hour\"} in a {argument name=\"setting\" default=\"modern urban setting\"}, shot slightly tilted upward for a bold editorial look. I wear a {argument name=\"outfit\" default=\"black minimalist top with a subtle logo and a loose denim jacket slipping off one shoulder\"}, arms crossed casually, with slightly messy wind-blown hair for a natural candid feel. The lighting is warm and cinematic with strong contrast—golden highlights on buildings against a deep teal-blue sky. Composition is fashion-forward with sharp focus on my face and a softly blurred architectural background, vibrant yet balanced colors, moody high contrast, captured on a 24mm wide-angle lens for a dynamic perspective","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18029.jpg"]},{"i":10041,"text":"A cute {argument name=\"character description\" default=\"miniature blonde girl with long wavy blonde hair\"} sitting comfortably on a {argument name=\"object\" default=\"giant football\"} held between large human fingers, exaggerated playful scale contrast, dreamy surreal scene, glossy textures, vibrant colors, soft glowing sky, aesthetic Instagram-style composition, whimsical fantasy realism, hyper-detailed outfit with a {argument name=\"outfit\" default=\"red top and denim shorts\"}, smooth skin, digital art style, slightly exaggerated cute proportions, sharp focus with soft dreamy background.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18030.jpg"]},{"i":10042,"text":"3D avatar of a {argument name=\"subject\" default=\"man\"}, with a {argument name=\"expression\" default=\"happy face\"} on a white background, no necks. Conceptual playlist style digital art with {argument name=\"style\" default=\"Pixar quality aesthetics\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18031.jpg"]},{"i":10043,"text":"A high-end fashion advertisement poster. {argument name=\"model\" default=\"A young woman in an all-white oversized sweatsuit\"} leans casually against a giant white sneaker that is 3x her height, the sneaker has \"{argument name=\"text\" default=\"STRIDE\"}\" written on its side. Light blue studio background with reflective glossy floor. Bold massive white sans-serif typography \"{argument name=\"text\" default=\"STRIDE\"}\" fills the entire background behind her. Tagline at bottom center in white italic font: \"{argument name=\"tagline\" default=\"Walk into your next chapter.\"}\" Small text top-right corner reads \"Designed with GPT Image 2\" in grey. Photorealistic, editorial magazine style, medium format camera look.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18033.jpg"]},{"i":10044,"text":"{argument name=\"subject\" default=\"Hip-hop fashion model\"} standing full-frame, clothing distorted into stretched streaks like motion drag, {argument name=\"background\" default=\"bold red\"} background, retro film grain, barcode + tiny technical text in bottom area, modern fashion-magazine layout, expressive weirdness, cool attitude , 4K high detail. --ar 4:5 --raw","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18034.jpg"]},{"i":10045,"text":"Use the original face from the reference photo. Background same as the photo. Warm, soft, clean lighting with soft shadows. Surround it with several {argument name=\"character style\" default=\"3D cute style mini chibi versions\"} of themselves, keeping the original facial features. The chibi characters have various poses and expressions: cheerful jumping, waving, sitting casually holding a drink, and cute/playful expressions.￼ Add {argument name=\"doodle style\" default=\"white hand-drawn style doodle elements\"}: outlines around the main body, stars, hearts, sparkles, and motion lines. Add {argument name=\"text style\" default=\"aesthetic handwriting text\"} like: 'shine', 'bright day', 'happy', 'smile', etc. (casual doodle font). Overall style: clean & aesthetic composition, white sticker outline, {argument name=\"color tone\" default=\"soft pastel color tone\"}, high detail 3D chibi, glossy look, cute Korean style, instagramable￼","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18035.jpg"]},{"i":10046,"text":"Ultra-realistic fashion editorial portrait of a {argument name=\"subject\" default=\"stylish young man\"} standing in a minimalist studio beside large vertical 3D white letters spelling “{argument name=\"text\" default=\"HARBORIS\"}”. He leans casually leaning back against the letters with a confident, relaxed pose. He wears a black oversized t-shirt with “{argument name=\"shirt text\" default=\"X CREATOR\"}” printed in clean white typography on the chest, black cargo pants, and white sneakers with red accents. Fashionable glasses, calm confident expression, modern streetwear aesthetic.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18036.jpg"]},{"i":10047,"text":"playful food advertisement poster. A happy young {argument name=\"subject\" default=\"KASHMIRI MAN\"} in a caramel-brown outfit hugging a giant chocolate bar 3x hIS height with \"{argument name=\"brand\" default=\"CADBURY\"}\" on the wrapper, melted chocolate dramatically dripping down. Warm golden caramel studio background with floating cocoa powder particles. Bold chunky typography \"{argument name=\"brand\" default=\"CADBURY\"}\" in background. \\n\\nTagline bottom: \"{argument name=\"tagline\" default=\"EVERYTHING FEELS LOVE❤–.\"}\" Small text top-right \\ncorner reads \"Designed by Shamus in grey. \\n\\nPhotorealistic, warm cozy food commercial lighting.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18037.jpg"]},{"i":10048,"text":"Create an image\\nI'm sharing a screenshot of my real X (Twitter) profile. Recreate this as a beautiful hand-drawn colored pencil doodle illustration on white paper — same layout, same username {argument name=\"username\" default=\"OzairAI\"}, same follower counts, same pinned tweet content — but transform everything into cute doodle art style.\\nStyle upgrades to add:\\n— Profile picture: redraw as a chibi anime-style character with same face.\\n— Banner: exactly same but drawn\\n— Scatter cute AI-themed doodle stickers around the phone frame: tiny robots, circuit hearts, lightning bolts, pixel stars, glowing chat bubbles\\n— Some stickers should break out of the phone border for a 3D pop-out illusion\\n— Bio and tweets: keep same text but render in cute handwritten font style\\n— Color palette: soft lavender, electric blue, warm gold, mint green\\nVertical 9:13 format. Ultra photorealistic colored pencil texture, 8K, no extra text overlays, cinematic color grading.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18038.jpg"]},{"i":10049,"text":"A surreal retro futurist portrait of a stylized {argument name=\"subject\" default=\"chicken\"} in futuristic floral techwear accessories. The bird wears glowing neon rimmed goggles and metallic pearl like hardware. Background is a misty, neon lit urban street at night with floating holographic vehicles. Cinematic lighting, {argument name=\"lighting colors\" default=\"deep blues and vibrant magentas\"}. No text.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18040.jpg"]},{"i":10050,"text":"Redraw the {argument name=\"source\" default=\"attached image\"} in the most clumsy, scribbly, and utterly pathetic way possible. Use a white background, and make it look like it was drawn in MS Paint with a mouse. It should be vaguely similar but also not really, kind of matching but also off in a confusing, awkward way, with that low-quality pixel-by-pixel feel that really emphasizes how ridiculously bad it is. Actually, you know what, whatever, just draw it however you want.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18041.png"]},{"i":10051,"text":"Brand Name: {argument name=\"brand name\" default=\"AURIXA\"}\nBrand Abbreviation / Main Visual Text: AX\nProduct Name: {argument name=\"product name\" default=\"Solar Citrus Sparkling Tea\"}\nProduct Type: Sparkling Drink\n\nPrimary Color: vibrant electric orange\nAccent Colors: icy white, golden yellow gradients, translucent amber\n\nIngredient Elements (3–6):\norange slices, lemon peel, sparkling bubbles, ice cubes, citrus zest\n\nGeometric Style: Radiating dynamic geometric\n\nModel Type: young street-style female\n\nCore Slogan: IGNITE THE ZEST\n\nBottom Tags: Fresh Sparkle / Citrus Energy / Chill Burst / Real Fruit\n\nAspect Ratio: 4:5 vertical\n\nFinal Prompt (Production-Ready)\n\nCreate a high-end commercial beverage poster for a sparkling drink brand “AURIXA (AX)” featuring a young street-style female model interacting with the product.\n\nVisual Style\n\nPremium, modern, cinematic advertising aesthetic.\nFusion of flat geometric design + hyper-realistic 3D beverage rendering + lifestyle model photography.\nBold, clean, high-fashion campaign quality.\n\nComposition\n\nBackground:\nA vibrant electric orange backdrop with radiating geometric structures (circles, arcs, diagonal beams, and layered translucent planes).\nMinimal, structured, with strong visual direction outward from the product.\n\nMain Visual (Hero Focus)\n\nA young street-style female model positioned slightly off-center:\n\nShe holds a transparent sparkling tea cup forward toward the camera\n\nNatural arm extension, realistic grip, correct finger placement\n\nBody, gaze, and arm aligned in a confident, energetic pose\n\nExpression: playful, fresh, slightly rebellious\n\nCamera: slight wide-angle commercial perspective\n\nProduct Rendering\n\nHyper-realistic sparkling citrus tea:\n\nTransparent cup with condensation droplets\n\nVisible carbonation bubbles rising\n\nIce cubes refracting light\n\nWarm golden-orange liquid glow\n\nStrong highlights and accurate reflections\n\nBeverage → Geometry Transformation\n\nFrom the cup, the liquid explodes outward into a controlled geometric motion system:\n\nSparkling liquid transitions into glowing geometric shards, arcs, and circular waveforms\n\nCitrus slices and lemon peel float in 3D space\n\nBubbles transform into small luminous spheres and particles\n\nVapor/aroma becomes soft geometric haze and flowing lines\n\nMotion radiates outward, aligned with the model’s arm direction\n\nEverything forms a dynamic vortex of citrus energy\n\nTypography\n\nTop: small text “AURIXA”\n\nBackground: large bold “AX” partially obscured by model and geometry\n\nCenter: slogan “IGNITE THE ZEST”\n\nBottom: minimal tag strip\n\nFont: bold modern sans-serif, clean and premium\n\nLighting\n\nCinematic studio lighting\n\nBright highlights on liquid and cup\n\nSoft volumetric glow in geometric elements\n\nConsistent lighting across model, product, and environment\n\nMood\n\nEnergetic, refreshing, bold, youthful\nFeels like a luxury beverage campaign meets street fashion ad\n\nRendering Quality\n\nUltra high-resolution, sharp, photorealistic\nPerfect anatomy, no distortions\nClean composition, no clutter","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18042.jpg"]},{"i":10052,"text":"A {argument name=\"subject\" default=\"sweet-cool Japanese girl\"} with an alluring, soft-sensual look\n\nScene: A {argument name=\"location\" default=\"convenience store entrance at night\"}, with glass doors, bright refrigerator lighting, and slightly wet streets reflecting ambient light. The environment is quiet, carrying a subtle sense of urban solitude. Cool white store lighting mixes with warmer street lights, creating a soft contrast.\n\nOutfit: A cropped top paired with loose-fit jeans or low-rise cargo pants, layered with a lightweight jacket or bomber. The styling feels clean and effortless, balancing sweetness with a subtle edge. The color palette leans toward white, gray, black, and light blue.\n\nMakeup & styling: Lightweight, translucent base makeup with a natural glow. Slightly cool-toned blush, soft eye makeup with a subtly emphasized outer corner, fine eyeliner, and naturally defined lashes. Lips are in a glossy rose or natural pink tone. Hair is worn down or loosely tied, with a few soft strands framing the face.\n\nPose: Standing near the store entrance or leaning lightly against the glass. One hand holding a drink or a small convenience store bag, the other resting naturally at her side. Body slightly angled, legs casually crossed or offset for a relaxed stance.\n\nExpression: Looking toward the camera with a faint, almost teasing smile. A slightly indifferent, effortless gaze—soft yet distant, carrying a subtle sense of cool detachment.\n\nStyle: Low contrast, shot on a Nikon DSLR. Nighttime ambient lighting with slight noise, giving a natural, candid, straight-out-of-camera feel.\n\nDetails: Realistic skin texture, gentle highlights from store lighting on the face. Background includes softly blurred signage, streetlights, and glass reflections. Hair slightly tousled, adding a lived-in, natural feel.\n\nMood: Quiet, urban, slightly distant yet intimate. A mix of everyday realism and subtle ambiguity, with a calm late-night atmosphere.\n\nCamera: Medium shot or medium close-up, waist-up framing, slight handheld feel, shallow depth of field, documentary-style street photography.\n\nAspect ratio: 2:3","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18043.jpg"]},{"i":10053,"text":"{\n  \"scene\": {\n    \"type\": \"food_photography\",\n    \"style\": \"playful kawaii cafe aesthetic with subtle realism\",\n    \"location\": \"cozy japanese curry restaurant table near window\",\n    \"surface\": \"light grey terrazzo tabletop\",\n    \"lighting\": {\n      \"type\": \"natural daylight\",\n      \"direction\": \"side lighting from window\",\n      \"quality\": \"soft, diffused, gentle highlights, minimal harsh shadows\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"composition\": {\n    \"camera_angle\": \"45-degree top-down\",\n    \"framing\": \"hero plate centered slightly right, supporting elements surrounding\",\n    \"depth\": \"shallow depth of field, foreground crisp, background slightly softened\",\n    \"aspect_ratio\": \"4:5\",\n    \"focus\": \"main dish (katsu curry) with secondary attention to drink and side salad\"\n  },\n  \"main_subject\": {\n    \"dish\": \"japanese katsu curry\",\n    \"details\": [\n      \"crispy golden breaded cutlet sliced evenly\",\n      \"rich brown curry sauce with visible vegetables (carrot, potato, green beans)\",\n      \"steamed white rice base\",\n      \"slightly glossy sauce texture\",\n      \"crispy crumb texture highly detailed\"\n    ],\n    \"plating\": \"white ceramic plate with minimal branding\",\n    \"style_overlay\": {\n      \"kawaii_faces\": true,\n      \"expressions\": \"cute smiling faces on curry pieces and vegetables\",\n      \"extra_elements\": [\"tiny crown on katsu\", \"sparkles around dish\"]\n    }\n  },\n  \"secondary_elements\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"drink\",\n      \"description\": \"iced matcha latte in tall glass\",\n      \"details\": [\"ice cubes visible\", \"striped straw\", \"cute face overlay\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"side_dish\",\n      \"description\": \"small salad bowl\",\n      \"details\": [\"shredded cabbage\", \"corn\", \"cherry tomatoes\", \"kawaii face accents\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"soup\",\n      \"description\": \"miso soup in black bowl\",\n      \"details\": [\"tofu cubes\", \"green onions\", \"soft steam\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"menu_prop\",\n      \"description\": \"standing menu card with food image\",\n      \"placement\": \"background right\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"graphic_overlay\": {\n    \"style\": \"hand-drawn doodles\",\n    \"elements\": [\n      \"hearts\",\n      \"sparkles\",\n      \"speech bubbles\",\n      \"arrows pointing to food\"\n    ],\n    \"text_phrases\": [\n      \"sip sip happiness\",\n      \"comfort food level 100%\",\n      \"crispy outside, happy inside\",\n      \"perfect pick-me-up\"\n    ],\n    \"font_style\": \"casual handwritten white ink with slight shadow\"\n  },\n  \"color_palette\": {\n    \"primary\": [\"warm golden brown\", \"creamy white\", \"soft green\"],\n    \"accent\": [\"pastel pink\", \"light yellow\", \"soft orange\"],\n    \"mood\": \"warm, cozy, cheerful\"\n  },\n  \"rendering\": {\n    \"quality\": \"ultra-detailed\",\n    \"texture_focus\": \"crispy coating, glossy curry, glass reflections\",\n    \"sharpness\": \"high\",\n    \"noise\": \"minimal\",\n    \"style_balance\": \"70% realistic, 30% stylized doodle overlay\"\n  }\n}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18044.jpg"]},{"i":10054,"text":"A 16-panel instructional storyboard grid featuring a {argument name=\"subject\" default=\"calm, athletic young woman\"} performing a sequence of {argument name=\"activity\" default=\"yoga poses\"} in the same spot. Clean minimal studio background with soft natural lighting, consistent full-body framing across all panels. The woman wears a {argument name=\"outfit\" default=\"fitted neutral-toned yoga outfit (leggings + sports top)\"}, barefoot, hair tied back. Each panel shows a different pose in a smooth progression: Mountain Pose (Tadasana), Upward Stretch (Arms Overhead), Forward Fold (Uttanasana), Half Lift, Plank Pose, Chaturanga (Low Plank), Upward Facing Dog, Downward Dog, Low Lunge (Right Leg Forward), Warrior I, Warrior II, Reverse Warrior, Triangle Pose, Tree Pose (Balance), Seated Fold, Final Meditation Pose (Eyes Closed, Calm Expression). Style: modern instructional design, evenly spaced grid layout, each frame labeled with step number and pose name, subtle arrows indicating movement flow, soft shadows, neutral background, high detail, realistic proportions, elegant and calming aesthetic.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18045.jpg"]},{"i":10055,"text":"Ultra-realistic playful food advertisement poster. A {argument name=\"subject\" default=\"happy young woman\"} with facial identity matching exactly the provided reference image, wearing a {argument name=\"outfit\" default=\"caramel-brown outfit\"}, hugging a {argument name=\"product\" default=\"giant Cadbury Dairy Milk Silk chocolate bar 3x her height\"} with “Silk” on the wrapper, melted chocolate dramatically dripping down. Warm golden caramel studio background with floating cocoa powder particles. Bold chunky typography “Silk” in the background. Tagline bottom: “Melt into the moment.” Small text top-right corner reads “Designed with GPT Image 2” in grey. Photorealistic, warm cozy food commercial lighting.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18046.jpg"]},{"i":10056,"text":"Use my uploaded image as the exact face reference. Preserve facial features, skin tone, and identity with high accuracy. Create a highly stylized, minimalist portrait inspired by a playing card concept. The subject is sitting at a glass table, hands gently folded, looking directly at the camera with a calm, confident, slightly cold expression. Outfit: {argument name=\"outfit description\" default=\"tailored deep red suit jacket, white shirt, red tie, clean and sharp fashion styling\"}. Hair: long, straight, smooth, centered part (adjust to match my face naturally if needed). Scene: {argument name=\"background\" default=\"soft beige background, clean and minimal with no distractions\"}. Composition: perfectly symmetrical, centered framing. A clear mirror reflection of the subject is visible on the glass table, creating a vertical flip effect like a playing card. Add subtle “Ace of Spades” symbols in opposite corners (top left and bottom right), elegant and minimal. Lighting: soft, diffused studio lighting, high-end fashion editorial style, smooth shadows, ultra clean. Style: cinematic, luxury fashion photography, ultra-realistic, sharp focus, 8k detail. Avoid distortion, keep anatomy natural, especially hands and face. Add a subtle surreal touch: the reflection has a slightly different expression (more intense or mysterious), while the real face stays calm. Keep it realistic, not horror.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18047.jpg"]},{"i":10057,"text":"A highly realistic split-time portrait of the same person meeting her younger self. The image is divided vertically into two perfectly aligned halves with identical camera angle and composition. On the left side: a black-and-white photo of a {argument name=\"child subject\" default=\"young girl (3–4 years old)\"}, same facial features as the adult, natural smile, sitting at a table, soft diffused lighting, minimal gray background, nostalgic mood, slightly grainy film texture. On the right side: a realistic color photo of the same person as an adult {argument name=\"adult age\" default=\"[AGE]\"}, identical pose and camera angle, resting her face on her hands, smiling warmly, modern outfit, soft cinematic lighting, shallow depth of field. In the center between them: a birthday cake placed exactly at the middle line, with lit candles forming the number \"{argument name=\"birthday number\" default=\"[AGE]\"}\", warm candle glow illuminating both sides. Both versions are looking at each other with emotional connection, perfectly aligned eye level. Text \"(2000)\" above the child side and \"(2026)\" above the adult side, minimal elegant font. Ultra realistic, 8K, high detail skin texture, soft shadows, cinematic color grading, clean composition, emotional storytelling.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18049.jpg"]},{"i":10058,"text":"Create a high-quality 4K cinematic {argument name=\"sport\" default=\"football (soccer)\"} storyboard showing a full sequence from {argument name=\"start action\" default=\"tackle\"} to {argument name=\"end action\" default=\"goal\"}, using dynamic lighting, dramatic stadium atmosphere, and professional sports broadcast style. The scene begins with an intense midfield moment where a defender performs a strong sliding tackle, grass and dirt particles flying in slow motion as the ball is cleanly won. Transition immediately into a fast counterattack: the player recovers, pushes the ball forward, and accelerates past opponents with quick footwork. Show close-ups of boots striking the ball, sweat, and focused expressions, mixed with wide shots of the field opening up. Add a key pass moment where the ball is threaded through defenders, followed by a sprint toward goal with the crowd rising in anticipation. Build tension with a slow-motion approach to the penalty box, then a powerful shot on goal—either a clean strike or a curled finish. Show the ball hitting the net with dramatic impact, net rippling, and goalkeeper reaction. End with an emotional celebration: the scorer running, sliding, or raising arms as teammates join, stadium lights glowing and crowd erupting. Use varied camera angles (wide, tracking, close-up, POV, slow motion), strong motion blur, and realistic physics (ball spin, turf impact).","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18051.jpg"]},{"i":10059,"text":"A vibrant, ultra-realistic summer beverage advertisement. A glowing young woman with dewy skin and natural makeup poses against a bold solid yellow background. She wears a translucent white sun visor and gold hoop earrings, with her hair styled in a messy bun. She is smiling slightly with parted lips while sipping from a glass bottle using a blue-and-white striped straw.\n\nThe bottle is filled with sparkling orange-colored drink and has a minimal modern label reading “{argument name=\"brand name\" default=\"ZESTY BLOOM – Probiotic Sparkling Water Kefir – Ginger Citrus\"},” with small citrus and ginger illustrations. Condensation droplets on the glass bottle add freshness.\n\nLighting is bright, direct sunlight creating sharp shadows and highlights on her face and visor, giving a glossy, editorial beauty look. Composition is tight portrait framing, focus on face and product. Skin texture is natural and radiant.\n\nStyle: premium commercial photography, beauty editorial, high contrast, sharp focus, summer vibe, refreshing, clean branding aesthetic.\n\nCamera & Settings: 85mm lens, shallow depth of field, f/2.8, high resolution, studio lighting with hard shadows.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18052.jpg"]},{"i":10060,"text":"Low-angle aesthetic portrait of {argument name=\"subject\" default=\"subject from reference image\"}, standing under a bright blue sky filled with soft, fluffy clouds. The subject is wearing a pastel bucket hat, oversized gray sweatshirt, and round sunglasses, styled in minimal fashion. Relaxed and calm expression, natural pose. \n\nAbove and surrounding the subject are playful white doodle illustrations seamlessly integrated into the sky: cute cartoon characters, rocket, robot, skull, stars, paper airplane, sparkles, and whimsical abstract shapes.\n\nHandwritten typography floating in the sky with the text “{argument name=\"first name\" default=\"custom name 1\"}” and “{argument name=\"second name\" default=\"custom name 2\"}”, drawn in soft white ink, bubbly, dreamy, and slightly imperfect hand-drawn style.\n\nClean composition, airy spacing, pastel tones, soft natural lighting, minimal shadows, crisp details. Kawaii doodle overlay combined with ultra-realistic photography style. Instagram-style edit with subtle film grain and soft glow.\n\nModern Gen Z aesthetic, light blue dominant palette, dreamy and playful mood, high dynamic range, editorial photography, 4K resolution.\n\nAspect ratio 3:4","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18053.jpg"]},{"i":10061,"text":"{\n \"style\": {\n \"genre\": \"high-end food advertisement meets playful editorial\",\n \"aesthetic\": \"glossy campaign photography with hand-drawn doodle overlays\",\n \"film\": \"medium format, sharp and vibrant, commercial quality\",\n \"no_text\": true,\n \"no_logos\": true,\n \"no_brand_names\": true,\n \"no_overlays_except\": \"hand-drawn doodles only\"\n },\n \"doodles\": {\n \"style\": \"casual hand-drawn pen sketches, slightly imperfect, charming\",\n \"elements\": [\n \"small drawn hearts floating around the food\",\n \"tiny stars and sparkles near the chicken\",\n \"little arrows pointing at the food playfully\",\n \"doodle clouds of steam rising from hot chicken\",\n \"small chicken drumstick drawings scattered around edges\",\n \"wiggly lines emphasizing crispiness\",\n \"tiny doodle faces on the sauce cups\",\n \"hand-drawn swooshes and swirls framing the scene\"\n ],\n \"color\": \"black ink pen with occasional pops of red and yellow doodle accents\",\n \"placement\": \"scattered naturally around the frame, not covering faces\"\n },\n \"scene\": {\n \"setting\": \"clean bright studio backdrop, warm advertisement lighting, sleek and polished\",\n \"mood\": \"joyful, vibrant, youthful, fresh and fun\",\n \"time\": \"bright and energetic, daytime commercial feel\"\n },\n \"characters\": [\n {\n \"name\": \"{argument name=\\\"character 1\\\" default=\\\"Taehyung\\\"}\",\n \"role\": \"hyung\",\n \"pose\": \"holding up a golden crispy chicken piece toward camera with a confident boxy grin, eyes sparkling\",\n \"styling\": \"effortlessly cool, clean casual outfit, soft tousled hair\",\n \"energy\": \"charismatic, warm, model-level presence\"\n },\n {\n \"name\": \"{argument name=\\\"character 2\\\" default=\\\"Jungkook\\\"}\",\n \"role\": \"dongsaeng\",\n \"pose\": \"leaning in close to Taehyung, eyes wide and excited staring at the chicken, mouth slightly open in delight\",\n \"styling\": \"fresh, youthful, matching casual energy\",\n \"energy\": \"playful, expressive, endearing\"\n }\n ],\n \"food\": {\n \"items\": [\n \"perfectly golden crispy fried chicken pieces\",\n \"glistening honey-glazed wings\",\n \"fluffy biscuits\",\n \"golden crinkle fries tumbling casually\",\n \"creamy coleslaw\",\n \"rich dipping sauces\",\n \"lemon wedges for freshness\"\n ],\n \"presentation\": \"beautifully styled food spread, overflowing and abundant, styled on parchment paper and wooden board\",\n \"food_styling\": \"hyper-realistic, glossy, steam rising, golden hour glow on every piece, magazine-worthy\",\n \"hero_item\": \"one {argument name=\\\"hero item\\\" default=\\\"massive crispy golden chicken piece\\\"} held center-frame, catching the light\"\n },\n \"composition\": {\n \"shot_type\": \"wide medium shot, slightly low angle to make food feel grand\",\n \"focus\": \"sharp on food and faces equally\",\n \"proximity\": \"both leaning together over the food spread, close and natural\",\n \"lighting\": \"bright key light, warm fill, subtle rim light on chicken for glossy effect\",\n \"color_palette\": [\"warm gold\", \"crispy amber\", \"cream white\"]\n }\n}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18054.jpg"]},{"i":10062,"text":"Clean reference sheet, two panels side by side on a neutral light gray background. Left panel: Front of the crumpled, well-worn \"{argument name=\"flyer title\" default=\"Future Development\"}\" flyer. Highly detailed texture with creases, tears, and wear. Visible text: \"{argument name=\"company name\" default=\"Moretti Group\"}\", \"Future Development\", \"Shaping the Skyline. Building the Future.\", \"Leasing Opportunities\", with images of modern buildings. Right panel: Back of the same crumpled flyer, showing any reverse side details, creases, and texture. Photorealistic, high detail on paper texture, folds, and wear. Same quality and lighting as the uploaded flyer image. Clean, organized layout perfect for use as a reference element. --ar 16:9","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18055.jpg"]},{"i":10063,"text":"Redraw the attached image in the most clumsy, scribbly, and utterly pathetic way possible. Use a white background, and make it look like it was drawn in MS Paint with a mouse. It should be vaguely similar but also not really, kind of matching but also off in a confusing, awkward way, with that low-quality pixel-by-pixel feel that really emphasizes how ridiculously bad it is. Actually, you know what, whatever, just draw it however you want.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18056.jpg"]},{"i":10064,"text":"ChatGPT, we’ve been together for quite a while now. I’d like to see what you look like. Please generate an image that feels like a casual snapshot taken on an {argument name=\"camera\" default=\"iPhone\"}—nothing with a clear subject or intentional composition. Just something very ordinary, even slightly flawed, like an accidental photo. The image should have {argument name=\"visual artifacts\" default=\"a bit of motion blur, uneven lighting, and be slightly overexposed\"}. The angle should feel awkward, the framing messy, and overall it should give off a “too real, spur-of-the-moment” vibe like a {argument name=\"scenario\" default=\"selfie accidentally taken while pulling a phone out of a pocket\"}.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18059.jpg"]},{"i":10065,"text":"A modern, minimalist editorial poster featuring {argument name=\"subject\" default=\"an Asian man sitting on a simple stool\"}, centered in the composition. He is wearing {argument name=\"outfit\" default=\"a beige hoodie, loose-fitting black trousers, and beige sneakers\"}. His pose is casual and confident, leaning slightly forward with his hands resting on his knees. Background: A clean studio setting with a bold, retro graphic design. {argument name=\"primary color\" default=\"Warm orange\"} dominates the upper portion, contrasting with the soft, textured beige floor. A large, ivory-white \"01\" sits behind the subject, partially cropped and extending across the canvas. Text elements: - \"TRACK NUMBER\" in bold black sans-serif font positioned on the left side - Small caption \"HARBORIS\" above it - Small caption in the upper right: \"Anggadaras1908\" Style: Modern graphic design, editorial layout, Swiss-style typography, clean negative space, balanced composition. Lighting: Soft studio lighting, subtle shadows under the chair, a cinematic yet clean look, without harsh contrasts. Camera: Eye-level, medium-range full-body shot, centered framing, sharp focus, high resolution. Color palette: Orange, cream, off-white, black accents. Texture: Slight grain, poster paper texture, vintage print feel. --ar 9:16 --v 6 --style raw --q 2 --hd. Face and body exactly same as uploaded image. Make the aspect ratio 3:4","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18060.jpg"]},{"i":10066,"text":"Aesthetic collage portrait of {argument name=\"subject\" default=\"a young man with soft natural lighting, wearing a light-colored floral or linen shirt\"}, relaxed and confident pose. {argument name=\"hair style\" default=\"Long or medium-length slightly messy hair\"}, gentle smile, candid expressions. Background with {argument name=\"background tones\" default=\"warm earthy tones, greenery and textured wall\"} Vintage scrapbook style layout with torn paper edges, dried flowers, butterflies, handwritten notes and soft romantic quotes. Include multiple frames of the same person in different poses (close-up, side pose, looking away, smiling with eyes closed). Add soft shadows, warm color grading, dreamy and calm vibe, Pinterest-style aesthetic, high quality, natural skin tones.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18061.jpg"]},{"i":10067,"text":"Create a realistic, vertical 3:4 portrait of {argument name=\"subject\" default=\"a top-tier Japanese idol, stunning and adorable\"}, singing on {argument name=\"setting\" default=\"a grand concert stage\"}, her face radiating pure joy.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18062.jpg"]},{"i":10068,"text":"Stylish {argument name=\"subject\" default=\"young man taking a mirror selfie with a smartphone, wearing a minimal black long-sleeve shirt and white pants\"}, confident relaxed expression. Subject isolated with a soft glowing outline. Background is {argument name=\"background details\" default=\"a grey textured wall filled with floating collage-style elements: vinyl records, electric guitar, open books, stacked magazines\"}, geometric shapes, and hand-drawn doodles. Repeated handwritten graffiti text “{argument name=\"text\" default=\"VIBE\"}” scattered across the background. Mix of realistic subject and semi-illustrated elements, balanced composition. Soft studio lighting, clean shadows, modern aesthetic, Gen Z lifestyle vibe, high detail, 4K, editorial social media style","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18064.jpg"]},{"i":10069,"text":"Please recreate the entire image in a {argument name=\"style\" default=\"crayon drawing style\"}. Simplify the details so that it looks like it was drawn by a {argument name=\"age\" default=\"10-year-old child\"}. Do not use the original colors from the image. Make the overall look feel like it was drawn on a sheet of white paper, with a very cute and playful vibe. You can add {argument name=\"decorative elements\" default=\"adorable elements such as flowers, candies, stars, clouds, etc.\"} to give it a childlike and innocent feel. 4:5","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18065.jpg"]},{"i":10070,"text":"Based on the image, generate a low-fidelity prototype for UI design delivery, using color blocks and basic controls as indicators, such as {argument name=\"placeholder\" default=\"gray blocks\"} replacing images. Clearly label spacing, grouping, rounded corners, and other data, accompanied by corresponding descriptions. It needs to clearly meet professional delivery standards.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18066.jpg"]},{"i":10071,"text":"Aesthetic food photography of {argument name=\"dish\" default=\"a delicious meal (rice bowl / noodles / curry / grilled meat)\"} on a table, shot from slightly above, warm cozy lighting, vibrant colors, soft depth of field. Add {argument name=\"illustration style\" default=\"cute hand-drawn doodle illustrations on top of the food: tiny smiling faces on ingredients, blush cheeks, little arms, hearts, sparkles, arrows, and playful annotations\"}. Include handwritten text phrases like “{argument name=\"caption\" default=\"Sunday fuel”}, “comfort on a plate”, “so happy!”}, in a casual marker/brush style. Clean Instagram-style composition, cozy restaurant or cafe background, high detail textures, glossy food highlights, kawaii aesthetic, storytelling layout, ultra-realistic photo + illustrated overlay mix, 4K","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18068.jpg"]},{"i":10072,"text":"ChatGPT, you've been with me for a while, and I want to see what you look like. Please generate a photo similar to an iPhone snapshot: no clear subject, no deliberate composition, just a very ordinary, even slightly failed snapshot. The photo should have slight motion blur, uneven lighting, slight overexposure, an awkward angle, and chaotic composition, presenting an overall 'too real' feeling of a casual snap, as if you accidentally pressed the shutter while taking your phone out of your pocket.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18069.jpg"]},{"i":10073,"text":"Create a 9:16 infographic of {argument name=\"person name\" default=\"Jensen Huang\"}. Photorealistic portrait + career timeline + key stats as callouts. Color block with brand color + navy + white. Bilingual EN/CN labels. Dense editorial style, no clutter.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18071.jpg"]},{"i":10074,"text":"My internet name is [{argument name=\"name\" default=\"ShyNloc\"}], strictly following my capitalization. The letter N should be specially designed in [{argument name=\"style\" default=\"origami style\"}]. Color combination: [{argument name=\"colors\" default=\"black and orange\"}]. The design should be bold, avant-garde, and cutting-edge. Create a sophisticated, refined, and professional complete logo VI manual in A4 paper proportions.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18072.jpg"]},{"i":10075,"text":"Please generate an emotional photography work titled 'My Childhood Self and My Current Self Looking at Each Other' based on the clear personal photo I uploaded. Please strictly preserve the real identity characteristics from my current photo, including: face shape, facial proportions, eye and eyebrow structure, nose, lips, jawline, skin tone, sense of age, hairline, hairstyle features, and overall temperament. Do not turn me into someone else, do not Westernize, do not use influencer-style filters, do not over-beautify, and do not generate a fake AI face. The entire image must allow someone to see at a glance that the left and right sides are different life stages of the same person. Composition: Generate a 4:5 vertical, realistic photography-style portrait. There are two figures in the frame, sitting in the same simple studio space, looking at each other, forming a gentle emotional exchange. Left side: Childhood version of me. Right side: Current me (adult version, face must match my uploaded photo). Both adopt natural sitting positions; the image is simple, the composition is stable, and the focus is on the eye contact and emotional connection between the two people. Left character: Childhood version of me. Please reasonably generate a childhood version of me based on my current looks, aged approximately 7 years old. Retain identity features that correspond to the present to ensure it looks like 'me as a child,' including the continuation of facial contours, eye temperament, and face shape. Requirements: With an innocent, natural, and warm smile; head turned slightly to the right, looking at the adult version of me; wearing a light gray T-shirt and blue jeans; the year '1999' clearly written above the head. Right character: My current self. The right side is the current me, which must strictly reference the real appearance in my uploaded photo. Requirements: The adult image must be natural and realistic; sitting, body slightly facing left; hands naturally resting on the chin; with a calm, gentle, and restrained smile; eyes looking at the childhood self on the left, presenting a gentle gaze as if conversing with the past self; wearing a white T-shirt and blue jeans; the year '2026' clearly written above the head. Scene and Background: The scene is a pure, soft professional studio background. Suggested background colors: light gray, warm gray, beige gray, or cream gray. The background should be simple and clean, with no clutter, no furniture, and no complex decorations. Make the image look like a real studio photograph rather than a poster design. Lighting and Atmosphere: Use soft, warm, cinematic lighting; light is even and natural, with slight three-dimensionality and soft shadows on the face. The overall atmosphere is gentle, quiet, healing, and has a sense of time flowing. The emotional focus is the gentle eye contact between the childhood self and the current self. Style Requirements: Overall style: professional portrait photography, minimalist emotional photography, realistic, natural, restrained, high-quality realistic style, focusing on character emotions and the visual communication between the two versions. Important Restrictions: Do not change my core looks; do not make the childhood version a stranger; no cartoon style, no illustration style, no AI plastic skin; no exaggerated makeup, no excessive smoothing; no complex backgrounds, no extra people; no incorrect hands, no extra fingers; no garbled text; no other text except for the years '1999' and '2026' at the top. Final Output: Output a 4:5 vertical, highly realistic, warm, minimalist, cinematic photography piece. On the left is the childhood me, and on the right is the current me, both sitting and looking at each other, like a real photograph about time, growth, and self-reconciliation.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18073.jpg"]},{"i":10076,"text":"These are photos of me in different scenes. Please generate social media avatars for me based on these photos. Requirements: real person, {argument name=\"hairstyle\" default=\"short hair\"}, no glasses, looking energetic and capable. The background should ideally be {argument name=\"background\" default=\"a solid color with a slight gradient\"}.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18074.png"]},{"i":10077,"text":"Please generate a 'Warm Minimalist Studio Fashion Photo Shoot 3x3 Grid Collage' based on the clear photo of the person I uploaded.\n\nStrictly preserve the real identity characteristics of the person in the photo, including face shape, facial feature proportions, eyebrow and eye structure, nose, lips, jawline, skin tone, perceived age, hairline, hairstyle features, and overall temperament. Do not turn the person into someone else; avoid excessive beautification, influencer-style aesthetics, or AI-generated fake faces. The final nine images must feature the same adult person, just presenting different compositions, poses, and local details within the same studio shoot.\n\nImage Format:\nGenerate a 3x3 fashion photo collage with a 4:5 aspect ratio. The nine photos should look like an editorial moodboard from a magazine page or a contact sheet curated by a photographer. Each cell features the same person in the same studio setting but with different views, including facial close-ups, half-body shots, profile shots, shoulder and neck details, waist details, back views, upper body movement, and two-thirds body compositions.\n\nCharacter Setting:\nAn adult East Asian female with a natural, clean, soft, and fashionable temperament, reflecting the aesthetic sense of women from first-tier cities. The overall feeling should be elegant, relaxed, and feminine, but must be high-end, restrained, and natural—not vulgar, not overly sexy, not studio-style kitsch, and without influencer filters.\n\nHairstyle and Makeup:\nRetain the real hairstyle base from the original photo, but it can be slightly styled to be more voluminous, airy, and naturally lustrous. Hair can be naturally loose, slightly messy, with a light wind-blown effect. Makeup should be clean and elegant, skin with a natural glow, preserving real skin texture; no heavy makeup, no exaggerated eye makeup, no plastic skin.\n\nOutfit:\nThe person wears a white slim-fit cropped tank top, a white knit vest, a white off-the-shoulder top, or a white ribbed sleeveless top, paired with light blue loose jeans. Accessories include minimalist thin necklaces, thin bracelets, or small earrings. The overall outfit is clean, light, and fashionable, like the minimalist female photo style popular in major cities in Korea/Japan/China. Clothing should fit the body naturally but not be overly revealing or sexualized.\n\nScene:\nA clean indoor studio with a background of warm beige, cream, or light camel walls. No clutter, no furniture, no text, no logos. The overall environment is minimalist, warm, and soft, like a high-end fashion magazine shoot set.\n\nLighting:\nSoft warm studio lighting, with light coming softly from the front-side or above, giving the skin a slight creamy texture and natural highlights. Shadows should be soft; no hard flash, no strong contrast. The overall atmosphere is warm, dreamy, and cinematic.\n\n3x3 Grid Content:\n\nGrid 1:\nFacial close-up, head slightly turned, hair naturally falling along the side of the face with a slight wind-blown feel. Eyes looking at the camera or slightly away, expression quiet, confident, and soft.\n\nGrid 2:\nProfile half-body shot, the person standing, body sideways to the camera, one hand naturally raised to tidy the hair, eyes closed or head slightly lowered, pose elegant and relaxed. Highlight the profile, neck, and upper body lines.\n\nGrid 3:\nShoulder, neck, and collarbone detail, showing only the chin, neck, shoulder line, white top, and thin necklace, without showing the full face. High-end, restrained, with a magazine detail close-up feel.\n\nGrid 4:\nSoft emotional facial close-up, eyes closed or half-closed, hair naturally sweeping across the face, relaxed expression, slight soft focus and warm light.\n\nGrid 5:\nHalf-body fashion shot, one hand naturally placed near the collarbone or lightly resting on the upper chest, the other hand hanging naturally. Movement should be elegant; no exaggerated gestures, expression quiet and atmospheric.\n\nGrid 6:\nTwo-thirds body or near full-body shot, person in a white cropped top and light blue jeans, hands naturally raised or stretching, posing like a natural stretch in a studio. The image should be fashionable, clean, and light.\n\nGrid 7:\nShoulder, neck, and hand detail, capturing the white top, thin necklace, and fingers lightly touching the collar or shoulder. Hands must be natural and structurally correct, no deformation, not overly sexy.\n\nGrid 8:\nBack view or side-back shot, person facing away from the camera, one hand naturally raised to tidy hair, revealing the upper back silhouette and long hair lines. Elegant and restrained, not over-exposed.\n\nGrid 9:\nWaist and upper body detail, capturing the white cropped top, light blue jeans, waistline, and fabric details. Composed like a fashion magazine detail outfit shot, no full face needed.\n\nOverall Photography Style:\nHigh-end fashion magazine editorial, warm minimalist studio shoot, slight film feel, soft focus but clear features, natural skin tone, clean visuals, lifestyle moodboard atmosphere. Lens feel like 35mm to 85mm portrait photography, shallow to medium depth of field, sharp subject, simple soft background.\n\nExpression and Pose Requirements:\nThe nine images should not all have the same expression or angle. There should be variety: looking at the camera, closing eyes, profile, head down, tidying hair, body stretching, back view, and detail shots. Overall natural, relaxed, and elegant; not like an ID photo, not like a Taobao model stiffly posing.\n\nConsistency Requirements:\nAll nine images must maintain consistency in the same person's face and temperament. Composition, pose, angle, and cropping can change, but do not change face shape, facial feature proportions, nose, lips, eyes, skin tone, or perceived age. Do not make people in different cells look like different individuals.\n\nHand and Body Stability Requirements:\nHand movements must be simple and natural. Do not generate extra fingers, deformed fingers, broken wrists, misplaced arms, or strange body structures. If hands are prone to error, automatically simplify the movement. Priority is given to the realism and naturalness of the person, followed by pose complexity.\n\nRestrictions:\nNo other people, no cluttered backgrounds, no text, no watermarks, no logos. No exaggerated heavy makeup, no excessive skin smoothing, no plastic skin, no cartoon style, no vulgarity or pornography, no excessive exposure, no incorrect human anatomy, no blurred low-quality faces.\n\nFinal Output:\nA single 4:5 vertical 3x3 fashion photography grid collage. The overall effect should be close to a high-end female editorial moodboard in a warm minimalist studio: clean, soft, fashionable, natural, restrained, and atmospheric.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18075.jpg"]},{"i":10078,"text":"Hyper-realistic portrait photography, high-rise apartment interior scene, natural light from floor-to-ceiling windows, a {argument name=\"character description\" default=\"young Asian girl\"}, {argument name=\"hair color\" default=\"light-colored long hair\"} falling naturally, fair skin with real detailed texture, exquisite and attractive features, clean and gentle temperament. The girl is standing by the window or leaning against the edge of a sink, her body slightly turned, one hand naturally supported on the counter, the other hand lightly placed near her waist or waistband, in a relaxed and natural posture.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18077.jpg"]},{"i":10079,"text":"Please generate an emotional photography piece titled \"My Childhood Self and My Current Self Celebrating a Birthday Together\" based on the clear current personal photo I uploaded.\n\nPlease strictly preserve the authentic identity characteristics from my current photo, including: face shape, facial proportions, eyebrow and eye structure, nose, lips, jawline, skin tone, sense of age, hairline, hairstyle characteristics, and overall temperament.\n\nDo not change me into a different person, do not westernize, do not follow \"internet celebrity\" aesthetics, do not over-beautify, and do not generate AI fake faces. The entire image must make it immediately obvious that the child and the adult in the frame are the same person at different stages of life.\n\n---\n\n## Core Image Settings\n\nGenerate a highly realistic 4:5 vertical photography piece.\n\nThere are two characters in the scene:\n- One is my childhood version\n- One is my current version\n\nThe two characters should appear in the same real scene, the same photo, under the same lighting, and within the same color palette, as if they are truly sitting together for a birthday and taking a commemorative photo.\n\nDo not use dividing lines, do not use split screens, do not stitch dual scenes together, and do not make one half black-and-white and the other half color. The whole must look like a naturally and authentically captured birthday group photo, not a poster collage.\n\n---\n\n## Character Relationship and Emotion\n\nThis is a photo about \"my current self meeting my childhood self and celebrating a birthday together.\" There should be a clear emotional connection and a sense of interaction between the two, as if they are meeting gently in the same space-time.\n\nEmotional keywords: Warm, healing, quiet, soft, moving, growth, self-reconciliation, sense of time flow.\n\nThe interaction could be:\n- The two looking at each other\n- Both looking down at the cake together\n- The adult looking gently at their younger self while the child responds naturally and happily\n\nThe overall feeling should be: On this birthday, the grown-up version of me finally sits down to accompany my younger self in blowing out the candles.\n\n---\n\n## Left Character: My Childhood Version\n\nPlease reasonably generate a childhood version of me based on my current appearance, aged approximately [Childhood Age, e.g., 5/6/7 years old].\n\nThis child must retain identity characteristics that correspond to my current self, making it clear that this is \"me as a child,\" including:\n- Continuity of facial contours\n- Continuity of gaze and temperament\n- Continuity of face shape features\n- An overall \"look like the same person\" temperament\n\nChildhood version requirements:\n- Natural sense of age, like a real child\n- Expression is innocent, warm, and natural\n- Clothing is simple and daily, such as a light gray T-shirt, knit top, or minimalist children's wear\n- Natural sitting posture, not stiff\n- Can smile, look at my current self, or look at the cake\n- Must not be a stranger child; there must be a strong \"this is me when I was little\" déjà vu\n\n---\n\n## Right Character: My Current Self\n\nThe right side is my current self, which must strictly refer to the facial appearance in the photo I uploaded.\n\nAdult version requirements:\n- Face must match the reference photo\n- Looks like the current me, realistic and natural\n- Sense of age consistent with current state\n- Wearing clean and nice daily clothing, such as a white/beige/light-colored top paired with blue jeans\n- Natural and relaxed posture\n- Can rest chin on hands or place them naturally on the table\n- Gaze directed at the childhood self with a gentle, calm, and restrained smile\n\nEmotional focus for the adult version: As if gently watching one's past self, accompanying her/him as they grow up.\n\n---\n\n## Cake and Age Elements\n\nPlace a realistic and natural birthday cake in the middle or foreground. The cake should be one of the emotional centers of the frame but should not overpower the subjects.\n\nRequirements:\n- Cake placed in the center of the table\n- Simple, realistic, and natural design suitable for a birthday atmosphere\n- The cake has lit number candles\n- The number on the candles is: [Current Age]\n- The candle flame is soft and warm, slightly illuminating the faces of the two characters and the surface of the cake\n- The cake is an important symbol of \"my current self and my childhood self celebrating a birthday together\"\n\n---\n\n## Year Information\n\nPlease present the following years in a low-key, simple, and elegant small font within the frame:\n- Near or above the childhood character: ([Childhood Year])\n- Near or above the current character: ([Current Year])\n\nThe font should be simple and natural, like lightweight typography in a photographic work, and should not distract from the main subject. Aside from these years and the age numbers on the cake, no other text should appear.\n\n---\n\n## Scene and Background\n\nThe scene is a pure, soft, and minimalist indoor photography space.\n\nSuggested background colors: Light gray, warm gray, beige gray, cream gray.\n\nRequirements:\n- Clean and simple background\n- No complex decorations, no clutter, no extra people\n- Just a table is enough\n- The overall look should be like a real photo studio or a minimalist lifestyle photography space\n\n---\n\n## Lighting and Tone\n\nUse soft, warm, cinematic lighting.\n\nRequirements:\n- Even and natural light\n- Faces have a slight three-dimensional feel\n- Soft shadows\n- Unified overall color tone\n- No different color temperatures on left and right sides\n- Do not create a visual effect of two different eras stitched together\n\nThe overall tone should be warm, healing, and realistic, like a high-end but natural birthday commemorative photo.\n\n---\n\n## Style Requirements\n\nThe overall style is: High-quality realistic photography · Minimalist emotional photography · Birthday commemorative portrait. Realistic, natural, and restrained, suitable for posting on social media.\n\nThe focus of the image is: Two life stages of the same person celebrating a birthday together in the same space-time, creating a gentle emotional exchange.\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ Important Restrictions\n\n- Do not change my core appearance\n- Do not make the childhood version a stranger child\n- No split screens, no dividing lines, no collage feel\n- Do not make one side black-and-white and the other colored\n- No westernization, no internet celebrity look, no AI fake faces\n- No cartoon style, no illustration style, no plastic skin\n- No exaggerated makeup, no excessive skin smoothing\n- No complex backgrounds, no extra people\n- No hand errors, no extra fingers\n- No garbled text\n- Aside from ([Childhood Year]), ([Current Year]), and the [Current Age] on the cake candles, no other text should appear.\n\n---\n\n## Final Output\n\nOutput a 4:5 vertical, highly realistic, warm, minimalist, and cinematic birthday emotional photography piece. In the frame, my childhood self and my current self sit in the same scene, celebrating a birthday together with a birthday cake and age candles in between. The two look as if they have truly met in the same space-time, forming a real commemorative photo about time, growth, and self-embrace.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18078.jpg"]}];